# Atomic UI8px

Full doc: [`docs/atomic-ui8px.md`](../../docs/atomic-ui8px.md)

## Three channels

| Kind | Where |
|------|-------|
| Visual presets (`variant`, `size`, …) | `*.variants.json` only |
| Layout / spacing / responsive | Caller `class` / `$class` |
| Design tokens | `presets/styles/*.css` |

## MUST NOT

- Duplicate variant maps in PHP/Latte by hand
- Semantic layout props on brick APIs (`gap=`, `flex=`)
- Empty-string variant keys or default `""`
- `unstyled` escape hatch — add a named variant
- Second semantic-CSS extraction (`data-slot` → `.button-primary`)

After recipe changes: `php tools/ui8kit3/presets.php` (kit presets); primitives update via `npx ui8kit@3 add --all --force`
